<%- include('partials/header') %>

<section class="mkt-hero">
  <p class="mkt-eyebrow"><%= productName %></p>
  <h1>Run your flooring company from one workspace</h1>
  <p class="mkt-lead">
    Capture leads, move deals through a sales pipeline, convert customers, and build accurate estimates —
    with every company’s data isolated on its own subdomain.
  </p>
  <div class="mkt-cta-row">
    <a class="btn" href="/signup">Start 30-day free trial</a>
    <a class="btn btn-secondary" href="/pricing">See pricing</a>
  </div>
  <p class="mkt-fineprint">No credit card required. Your workspace lives at <code>{your-company}.<%= appRootDomain %></code></p>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section">
  <div class="mkt-section-head">
    <h2>Built for flooring operations</h2>
    <p>The daily tools installers and sales teams actually use — without the ERP complexity.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="feature-grid">
    <article class="feature-card">
      <h3>Lead capture &amp; pipeline</h3>
      <p>Track every inquiry from first contact to won/lost with stages you can customize per company.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <h3>Customers in one place</h3>
      <p>Convert qualified leads into customers and keep contact details ready for estimating and follow-up.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <h3>Flooring estimates</h3>
      <p>Quote hardwood, LVP, laminate, tile, and carpet using waste and markup rules configured by your team.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <h3>Team access control</h3>
      <p>Invite staff with roles and permissions so sales, project managers, and admins see only what they need.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <h3>Your brand, your workspace</h3>
      <p>Set company name, logo, and primary color — reflected across the app without touching code.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="feature-card">
      <h3>Tenant isolation</h3>
      <p>Each organization runs on its own subdomain with application-level and database-level data isolation.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section mkt-section-alt">
  <div class="mkt-section-head">
    <h2>How it works</h2>
    <p>From signup to first quote in minutes.</p>
  </div>
  <ol class="steps">
    <li>
      <span class="step-num">1</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Create your organization</h3>
        <p>Choose a company name and subdomain. You become the first admin.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="step-num">2</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Invite your team</h3>
        <p>Send invitations and assign roles — permissions take effect immediately.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <span class="step-num">3</span>
      <div>
        <h3>Run the pipeline</h3>
        <p>Add leads, convert customers, and generate estimates with your flooring rules.</p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ol>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section">
  <div class="credibility">
    <h2>Designed for multi-company SaaS from day one</h2>
    <p>
      Every business record belongs to an organization. Isolation is enforced in the application layer and
      reinforced with Postgres Row-Level Security — so one company’s data never leaks into another’s workspace.
    </p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="mkt-section mkt-section-alt">
  <div class="mkt-section-head">
    <h2>Simple pricing</h2>
    <p>Start with a free trial. Higher tiers are listed so you can plan ahead.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="pricing-teaser">
    <div class="pricing-teaser-card">
      <h3>Starter</h3>
      <p class="price-line"><span class="price">Free</span> <span class="muted">30-day trial</span></p>
      <p>Leads, customers, quotes, team invites, and branding.</p>
      <a class="btn" href="/signup">Start free trial</a>
    </div>
    <p class="mkt-fineprint"><a href="/pricing">Compare all plans →</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<%- include('partials/footer') %>
